WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.719 --> 00:00:06.410
I think trans people should be allowed to
use whatever bathroom they want to use.

00:00:06.410 --> 00:00:08.680
Thank you.

00:00:08.680 --> 00:00:10.000
But

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.520
I don't think suicidal people should
because they make a mess.

00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:19.060
Have you ever seen...

00:00:19.060 --> 00:00:22.920
They don't always clean up after themselves.

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:25.700
These suicide-Americans.

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:27.360
I'm Asian I can say that.

